assets/steam/apps/2075480/extras/67e01a3a01d496048bb337379af35cbd.poster.avif?t=1729182501\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075480/extras/67e01a3a01d496048bb337379af35cbd.webm?t=1729182501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2075480/extras/67e01a3a01d496048bb337379af35cbd.mp4?t=1729182501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Change your colors and outfits to differentiate yourself from others !",
